  "text": "Hi Rodrigo, it's Claire. I read your report about the stockout. My advice: you shouldn't use the second supplier every month, because it is expensive. You should talk to the customer about the forecast for next year. And you should send me the numbers on Friday. We can talk on Monday. Thank you!",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a22_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "New York in October: three tips for visitors. First, the weather is cool, so you should bring a jacket. Second, you should use the subway: it is fast and it is cheap. And you shouldn't take a taxi at five in the afternoon, because the traffic is terrible. Enjoy the city!",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a22_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
